    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"the end of the performance\"... that hits really hard. it's like you're saying he should just stop playing the part. but if he does that, he's gone. for the story, and... i don't know, it's just a really dark thought to sit with. do you really think that's the best way to handle it? to just let him give up?",
